OL,3,GNEWSACall to remove 'eyesore' boulders
OL,4,Ain village laybys
OL,5,
OL,6,FA resident of a Staffordshire village
OL,7,Fis calling on a council to remove
OL,8,F'eyesore' large boulders and rubble
OL,9,Fblocking viewing laybys in the area.
OL,11,FNicola Beckett said the boulders began
OL,12,Fappearing on Congleton Road in Mow Cop
OL,13,F- on the Staffordshire and Cheshire
OL,14,Fborder - in March, and residents
OL,15,Fbelieved they were in response to
OL,16,Fanti-social behaviour and "large
OL,17,Fgatherings" taking place there.
OL,19,FBeckett, from nearby Harriseahead,
OL,20,Festimated that there was "in excess of
OL,21,Fabout 40 tonnes of construction waste
OL,22,Fand excavated material".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
